1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,696
Part six. Customers.

2
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:08,261
Customers are the homes and businesses you sell to.

3
00:00:08,261 --> 00:00:11,328
Open CRM, then Customers, and open one.

4
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:19,242
Everything about them is on one page: contact details, segment and lifecycle,

5
00:00:19,242 --> 00:00:25,726
and below that their quotations, invoices, payments, projects, tickets,

6
00:00:25,726 --> 00:00:27,643
photos and documents.

7
00:00:28,530 --> 00:00:34,245
Statement PDF lists every invoice and payment with the running balance.

8
00:00:34,245 --> 00:00:40,524
Print it, save it as PDF, or share it on WhatsApp to collect pending payments.

9
00:00:41,410 --> 00:00:44,486
To add a customer, tap New Customer.

10
00:00:44,486 --> 00:00:48,587
Type the PIN code: if you leave the state empty,

11
00:00:48,587 --> 00:00:52,432
it is filled from the PIN code when you save.

12
00:00:52,432 --> 00:00:57,217
The state decides CGST plus SGST or IGST on their bills,

13
00:00:57,217 --> 00:01:01,148
and a business customer's GSTIN also gives it.

14
00:01:02,050 --> 00:01:09,045
At the customer's site, tap Use my location to save the exact spot from the phone's

15
00:01:09,045 --> 00:01:09,383
GPS.

16
00:01:09,383 --> 00:01:10,225
Then save.

17
00:01:11,130 --> 00:01:15,183
The map view shows all your customers on the map of India.

18
00:01:15,183 --> 00:01:19,236
Choose a state to zoom in to its cities and each customer.

19
00:01:30,780 --> 00:01:35,069
Next video: Site survey and site photos with GPS.

